Dekhte dekhte guitar chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Batti Gul Meter Chalu sung by Atif Aslam. It is a version of Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan's Qawwali Sochta Hoon Ke Woh Kitne Masoom The.

Strumming Pattern: DDU DD or D UUD UUD

